      {
        "id": "block-shape-walkthrough",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "两个形状示例",
        "moduleId": "residual-shape",
        "depth": "core",
        "markdown": "教材用两个例子验证形状。输入 `X = torch.rand(4, 3, 6, 6)` 送入 `Residual(3, 3)`，输出仍是 `torch.Size([4, 3, 6, 6])`，此时输入可以直接相加。改用 `Residual(3, 6, use_1x1conv=True, strides=2)`，输出变成 `torch.Size([4, 6, 3, 3])`：通道数从 3 翻倍到 6，高宽各减半，这正是 $1\\times1$ 投影加步幅 2 的效果。",
